# Stalwart Successor: "Whenever one or more counters are put on a creature you control, if it's the first time counters have been
# put on that creature this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature" (CR 603.2c, 603.4). On turn 5 Bot1's Dockworker Drone
# enters with a +1/+1 counter, the Successor gives it a second, and Alchemist's Assistant's renew gives it a lifelink counter.
# Sacrificed to Ashnod's Altar, the Drone puts its counters, two +1/+1 and a lifelink, on the Successor at once: one time
# counters are put on it, the first this turn, still so as the ability resolves. The Successor ends with three +1/+1 counters.

